{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5512da92a94e238279ef6b050b0808671bd3f0b4f826d11e59d5750bf4184864","ja":"さてさて、茜ちゃんの舌を満足させる\nショコラティエはどこかニャ～？","zh":"那么，能满足小茜挑剔舌头的\n巧克力甜点师会在哪里喵～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"36bac836c073b7dfabd954c14d8ca74e9722794d3f36dce8a922d28d2c69762d","ja":"せっかくだから、いろんなのを食べたいよね！\nチョコアートの展示も見てみたいな。","zh":"难得来一次，想多尝几种不同的呢！\n也好想去看看巧克力艺术展啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"eca0b2b704520ba0fc814dcab025b73dd193e6856957b636ec9d410636bb627d","ja":"あっ、あそこにあるよ！\nチョコレートでできたお城！　おっきい～！","zh":"啊，在那边！\n用巧克力做的城堡！好大啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d5f1be8c41c1c4acc126dc06eeb287a7fc864ff60f01745855d917814b765368","ja":"ミニチュアの兵士たちもいるよ、\nすっごくカワイイね♪","zh":"还有微缩的小士兵呢，\n超级可爱♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e4615c2ce0f5afc4039450db57fc6d60fa064f6b1b9054303acbcc76799edefc","ja":"チョコレートの国……。\nいいところ……だと、思うな……。","zh":"巧克力王国……。\n我觉得……会是个好地方呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"80ce3aac99885b52f66a002828f6bfd6c0b5fd62a31e42fee6a461c65055c96e","ja":"茜ちゃんは閃いたよ！　ここで優秀な\nショコラティエさんと知り合って……。","zh":"小茜灵机一动！只要在这里和优秀的\n巧克力师傅认识的话……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"900f81a2a92993da37748fe7627ff1ec7d0738b65ec0d75587ba1cd2fed5e2a0","ja":"茜ちゃん特大チョコのサポーターに任命する！\n……見事な戦略でしょ！","zh":"任命你为小茜特大巧克力的应援者！\n……很精彩的策略吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"304a00723869329efaf2b458f67604394617018e12d8e409189a225cd1437faa","ja":"ふふっ、すっごく大きいのができそうだね。","zh":"呵呵，感觉能做个超级大的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"c5a17fe9613392d6cd714f006ed9d99dacc5f1f4f27414f807880c04281d77c5","ja":"あっ！　あっちに人だかりができてる！\nすごいショコラティエさんがいるのかも？","zh":"啊！那边聚了好多人！\n说不定有很厉害的巧克力大师在呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1008.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"6e33e8a229841c02153493b662702cd6bfa6693d1c80ffd7568ea78f515f74f6","ja":"じゃあ行ってみよっか。\nあれ、あのお店って……！？","zh":"那我们就去看看吧。\n哎，那家店是……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
